{'symbol': 'BRO', 'date': '2020-12-16 06:45:00', 'title': "BROWN & BROWN, INC. ENTERS INTO AGREEMENT TO ACQUIRE O'LEARY INSURANCES", 'text': "DAYTONA BEACH, FLA., DEC. 16, 2020 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- J. SCOTT PENNY, CHIEF ACQUISITIONS OFFICER OF BROWN & BROWN, INC. (NYSE:BRO), AND ANTHONY O'LEARY, THE MAJORITY OWNER OF O'LEARY INSURANCES (“OLI”), TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT BROWN & BROWN, INC. (“BROWN & BROWN”) HAS ENTERED INTO AN AGREEMENT TO ACQUIRE THE GENERAL INSURANCE OPERATING COMPANIES OF OLI. THE TRANSACTION IS EXPECTED TO CLOSE IN JANUARY 2021, SUBJECT TO CERTAIN CLOSING CONDITIONS."}